NOTE / 附加说明

This software PERMANENTLY DELETES FILES. Cleanup targets are limited to
temporary files and caches, and risky items (Recycle Bin, Windows.old, WinSxS
component cleanup) are disabled by default and require explicit confirmation,
but the authors accept no liability for data loss. Back up important data
before use.

本软件会永久删除文件。清理范围仅限临时文件与缓存，风险项（回收站、
Windows.old、WinSxS 组件清理）默认不勾选且需二次确认，但作者仍不对任何
数据丢失承担责任。使用前请备份重要数据。
